iew uses the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"centered 220×140 tan card, 888×1212 artboard, and full-bleed framing as the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"GitHub macOS runner evidence bound to this head.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/gesture(_:isEnabled:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/gesture(_:isEnabled:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/gesture(_:isenabled:)","title":"gesture(_:isEnabled:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"gesture","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"T","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"isEnabled","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"abstract":[{"text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI. One helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","type":"topic","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"}}}